BT 1 0 0 1 0 25.5 Tm /F1 9 Tf 11.5 TL (so in the ROC plot the blue line is above the orange one most of the way. The biggest difference is finding the heart) Tj T* (attack \(MI\) signals, raw found 29 out of 36 \(recall 0.81\) but features only found 19 out of 36 \(recall 0.53\) so it missed) Tj T* (almost half of them which is really bad for a sick person. Features was only a little better at Normal recall \(0.86 vs 0.83\).) Tj T* ET
