0 0 0 rg
BT 1 0 0 1 0 94.5 Tm /F1 9 Tf 11.5 TL (Regularization made a big difference. When C was really small \(0.001\) the regularization was way too strong and the) Tj T* (weights got squished almost to zero so both models just said Normal for everything and validation macro F1 was only) Tj T* (0.41 \(thats useless\). The features model was still stuck at 0.41 at C = 0.01 too. As C got bigger both got better. For raw) Tj T* (the best was C = 10 \(validation macro F1 0.89\) and at C = 100 it went down to 0.84 even though training accuracy was) Tj T* (already 100%, so it was starting to overfit and memorize the 80 training signals. The raw model needs regularization) Tj T* (more because it has 96 inputs and only 80 training signals. The features model liked the weakest one we tried \(C = 100\)) Tj T* (and its training accuracy only got to about 80% so it was not overfitting, it was more like underfitting because 10 features) Tj T* (is not enough info. Since its best C was at the end of the list, bigger C values could maybe be a tiny bit better but) Tj T* (probably not much.) Tj T* ET
